Package: criticalcaredescriptive
Title: Harmonised Descriptive Analysis Across Critical Care Databases
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Reproducible R workflows for harmonised descriptive analysis across critical care databases and versions
    included in the authors' database review. This DESCRIPTION file exists only to declare dependencies for renv;
    the project is run with the scripts in scripts/, not installed as a package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports:
    data.table,
    yaml,
    readr,
    ggplot2,
    gt,
    scales
Suggests:
    arrow,
    dplyr,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    openxlsx,
    renv
